# OpenStack Tempest Configuration: Test Skip Lists
#
# This configuration file defines regular expressions for tests to skip
# during the OpenStack Tempest suite execution. It is organized by
# subsystem/component to facilitate maintenance and debugging.
#
# Each variable corresponds to a specific schema field defined in the
# Ansible role. The `default` filter ensures valid output even if a
# variable is not provided, falling back to the schema's default value.

